{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"pet-feeding-calculator UI copy.fields.accuracyNote","detected_language":"ca","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"pet-feeding-calculator.copy.fields.accuracyNote","keys":["pet-feeding-calculator.copy.fields.accuracyNote"],"locale":"ca","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Aquesta eina no calcula ni recomana les necessitats de calories d' una mascota. Useu un objectiu proporcionat pel vostre veterinari i l' etiqueta exacta del paquet. L' energia dels aliments, els dolços, els suplements, el creixement, l' embaràs, les malalties i l' estat del cos poden canviar les necessitats d' alimentació; consulteu el vostre veterinari per a un pla individual.","record_id":"43da97023deca3ff019fc3d5788f2cd2f5bd0d328055e85f452b2f9bb8c37c28","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":1.9523775970000088,"source":"This tool does not calculate or recommend a pet’s calorie needs. Use a target provided by your veterinarian and the exact package label. Food energy, treats, supplements, growth, pregnancy, illness and body condition can change feeding needs; consult your veterinarian for an individual plan.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"28b454213cccfa42fcdf02b10acf0a239fc740edf9e309ee2206b331770cb79c","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Aquesta eina no calcula ni recomana les necessitats de calories d' una mascota. Useu un objectiu proporcionat pel vostre veterinari i l' etiqueta exacta del paquet. L' energia dels aliments, els dolços, els suplements, el creixement, l' embaràs, les malalties i l' estat del cos poden canviar les necessitats d' alimentació; consulteu el vostre veterinari per a un pla individual.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
